<!-- ABN_Loyalty.xml (UpdateDatabase). PLAN 7, branch L-B2 (DECISIONS #26). Owner: WP5.

     Loyalty ladder: five modifiers ABN_LOY_BIT_<n> (n = 1, 2, 4, 8, 16 = ABN_Config.LOY_BITS),
     MODIFIER_SINGLE_CITY_ADJUST_IDENTITY_PER_TURN with Amount -n, each gated by its own plot
     property ABN_DBIT_<n> >= 1 (REQUIREMENT_PLOT_PROPERTY_MATCHES on the city's plot). Each one is
     attached to every city by a GameModifiers row of type MODIFIER_ALL_CITIES_ATTACH_MODIFIER.
     ABN_Loyalty.lua sets ABN_DBIT_<n> to 1 or 0 on a city's plot from ABN_Config.Bits(D sum),
     so a city loses D loyalty per turn (D up to 31).

     The rows copy the spike rows of ABN_Dev\Data\ABN_Dev_Spike.xml (ABN_SPK_LOY_BIT_*) that were
     verified in game (SPIKES.md section 4: shows as "Other effects -6", re-levels to -9 and clears
     at once), renamed only: ABN_SPK_LOY_BIT_<n> -> ABN_LOY_BIT_<n>, ABN_SPK_ATTACH_BIT_<n> ->
     ABN_LOY_ATTACH_BIT_<n>, ABN_SPK_REQS_DBIT_<n> -> ABN_LOY_REQS_DBIT_<n>, ABN_SPK_REQ_DBIT_<n> ->
     ABN_LOY_REQ_DBIT_<n>, plot property ABN_SPK_DBIT_<n> -> ABN_DBIT_<n>. No ModifierStrings or
     text rows: the city panel shows the generic "Other effects" line, never the internal prefix. -->
